    "autoAttach": "Two different things (corrected WP 2.4a, 2026-10-24). (1) PRELOAD: the agent .md frontmatter `skills:` list (a subset of this map) is what Claude Code injects at startup, the FULL SKILL.md text into every dispatch of that agent, so it holds only what the agent needs on every dispatch. (2) ON DEMAND: shipped agents have no Skill tool, so every other skill listed here for an agent is not auto-loaded; the agent Reads it from disk when relevant (.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md, else ~/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md), or the Lead quotes it in the dispatch prompt together with the project-type bundle from config/skills/global-skills.json. No manual per-project reconnection.",
    "honesty": "Entries marked (ECC agent)/(method)/(tools) are agents, procedures, or tools — not SKILL.md files; they are invoked as what they are. Never claim a skill loaded that didn't.",
    "invocationNotes": {
        "_doc": "When a core skill above is only used in a specific situation. The array entries stay plain skill names (they must resolve to .claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md); the condition lives here. Added 2026-09-24 (wp13b + wp6b vendoring).",
        "forge-prompt-coach": "boss: not preloaded (WP 2.4a). Intake is the Lead's step (forge.md BUILD BY DEFAULT setup: at most ONE owner question via forge-prompt-coach); Boss Reads it from disk only when it handles a raw owner request itself (silent: at most one question; config intake/prompt-doctor/explain-mode).",
        "grill-me": "boss: only when config intake = interview, or when the owner asks to be grilled / questioned hard about a plan.",
        "grilling": "boss: only when config intake = interview, or when the owner asks to be grilled / questioned hard about a plan.",
        "teach": "docs-boss: beginner explanations (config explain-mode).",
        "wait-what": "docs-boss: re-explain when a message did not land with the owner (config explain-mode).",
        "claude-md-improver": "docs-boss: CLAUDE.md audit / improvement (the /revise-claude-md command).",
        "resolving-merge-conflicts": "build-boss: when a git merge or rebase stops on a conflict.",
        "setup-pre-commit": "build-boss: USER-INVOKED ONLY - it runs npm/npx and installs Husky + lint-staged into the repo; never invoke it unless the owner explicitly asks for pre-commit hooks.",
        "forge-skill-testing": "build-boss: not preloaded (WP 2.4a); Read from disk only when its package creates or changes a skill. test-boss and skill-boss preload it.",
        "forge-prd": "head-chef: not preloaded (WP 2.4a); the Lead/Boss write the PRD, Head Chef Reads the skill from disk when it needs the PRD format or amends a PRD (its own body carries the forge-prd.cjs clarifications check). boss and docs-boss preload it.",
        "forge-router": "skill-boss: not preloaded (WP 2.4a); Skill Boss Reads it from disk for the Step 0b Skill Discovery rules. boss and head-chef preload it."
    },
