        "_corrections_2026_09_24": "WP7 audit-repair, security review LOW #12: two entries in this historical block were wrong and are now fixed. (1) 'forge-website (SEO/perf sections)' is dropped from removed.seo-boss - forge-website DOES ship (.claude/skills/forge-website/SKILL.md exists) and was already restored into the live agents.ui-boss and agents.seo-boss core-skill lists above by the 2026-09-23 refill directly above; nothing further needed restoring. (2) 'nvidia-provider (forge-bin/nvidia-provider.cjs)' is dropped from removed.integration-boss - it is a forge-bin TOOL, not a Forge skill (no .claude/skills/nvidia-provider directory), so it never belonged in a skills-removed list; integration-boss still uses it as a tool, invoked as what it is, per this file's own honesty field."
